SUMMARY:Canceled Clovis: Seniors Access To Technology Class with Fresno EOC
DESCRIPTION:Seniors\, it's never too late to start your digital journey! 
 Want to learn how to use your smartphone or computer\, send emails\, or 
 connect with others and much more? Join our fun\, easy-to-follow technology 
 classes – no experience needed and absolutely FREE for people 60 years 
 and older!\n\nPlease bring your own device(s). Participants should plan on 
 attending as many of the 8 class sessions as possible.
LOCATION:Teen Area
ORGANIZER;CN="Mary Yamanaka":MAILTO:mary.yamanaka@fresnolibrary.org
CATEGORIES:General Interest
UID:LibCal-11006-17368833
URL:https://fresnolibrary.libcal.com/event/17368833
END:VEVENT
