BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260922T163000Z
DTEND:20260922T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260922T000000Z
SUMMARY:Clovis: Infant and Toddler Storytime
DESCRIPTION:Due to limited space\, please ensure that only your child is 
 registered. Guests and family members should not be included in the 
 registration. Please arrive 10 minutes early to check in. If you arrive 
 more than 5 minutes late\, your spot may be given to someone on the waiting 
 list.\n\nJoin us for an interactive Storytime designed especially for 
 toddlers\, ages 0 - 2 years old\, meant to benefit their brain 
 development\, social skills\, and communication skills. Enjoy stories\, 
 songs\, and fingerplays! Caregiver participation is encouraged.\n\nWalk-ins 
 are welcome on a first-come\, first-served basis.\n\nThe Children's area 
 will remain closed during the duration of our Storytime programs.\n\n\n\n 
 \n
LOCATION:Children's Area
ORGANIZER;CN="Isariya Locke":MAILTO:Isariya.locke@fresnolibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Storytimes
UID:LibCal-11006-17139568
URL:https://fresnolibrary.libcal.com/event/17139568
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260922T174500Z
DTEND:20260922T184500Z
DTSTAMP:20260922T000000Z
SUMMARY:Clovis: Preschool Storytime
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an interactive Storytime designed especially for 
 children ages 3 to 5\, meant to build pre-literacy and school readiness 
 skills. Enjoy stories\, songs\, and fingerplays. Stay after Storytime for a 
 fun craft activity! \n\nCaregiver participation is encouraged.\n\nDue to 
 limited space\, please ensure that only your child is registered. Guests 
 and family members should not be included in the registration.  Please 
 arrive 10 minutes early to check in. If you arrive more than 5 minutes 
 late\, your spot may be given to someone on the waiting list. \n\nWalk-ins 
 are welcome on a first-come\, first-served basis.\n\nThe Children's Area 
 will remain closed during the duration of our storytime programs.\n\n\n
LOCATION:Children's Area
ORGANIZER;CN="Isariya Locke":MAILTO:Isariya.locke@fresnolibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Storytimes
UID:LibCal-11006-17139628
URL:https://fresnolibrary.libcal.com/event/17139628
END:VEVENT
