SUMMARY:Clovis:  Alcohol Ink Bookmark Craft Program
DESCRIPTION:Teens: Are you in need of a bookmark?. Come to this program and 
 walk away with one that you created out of alcohol ink. You will say phew\, 
 now I have my own bookmark so I never lose where I am in this novel! \n\n 
 \n\n \n\n
