BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261027T171500Z
DTEND:20261027T181500Z
DTSTAMP:20261027T000000Z
SUMMARY:Clovis: Halloween Trick or Treat Parade
DESCRIPTION:Get on your costumes\, and come to the library for a special\, 
 Halloween Trick or Treat Parade! This event begins outside the North 
 entrance to the Clovis Library before heading out for a 1/4 mile walk 
 through some City of Clovis buildings to collect candy and Halloween cheer. 
 \n\nFamilies are welcome to dress up (yes\, adults too!)\, but costumes are 
 not required to attend. \n\nPlease Bring Your Own Bag to this event\, and\, 
 as this is a program for young children\, please restrain from wearing any 
 scary costumes. \n\nWe look forward to seeing you there!
ORGANIZER;CN="Zachary Camden":MAILTO:zachary.camden@fresnolibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Arts & Crafts
UID:LibCal-11006-17482744
URL:https://fresnolibrary.libcal.com/event/17482744
END:VEVENT
