SUMMARY:Clovis: Clovis Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Join us every first Thursday for our community-led Clovis Book 
 Club! Every month we choose a new genre to read. For November's meeting\, 
 we will be reading Detective Novels. Bring your book\, e-book\, or 
 audiobook and be ready to chat!
